WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:03.650
Wealth, fame, power...

3
00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.440
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates,

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.820
Gold Roger, the King of the Pirates, obtained everything the world has to offer.

5
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.360
attained this and everything else
the world had to offer.

6
00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.820
And his dying words drove
countless souls to the seas.

7
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.660
What he said in his final moments drove countless souls to the seas.

8
00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:13.660
You want my treasure?

9
00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.700
You can have it!

10
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.450
Go ahead.

11
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:17.040
I left everything I gathered
together in one place.

12
00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:16.660
Find it!

13
00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.250
Everything is right where I left it!

14
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.250
Now you just have to find it!

15
00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.750
These words lured
men to the Grand Line

16
00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:26.380
People set their sights on the Grand Line in pursuit of their dreams.

17
00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.920
in pursuit of dreams greater than
they'd ever dared to imagine!

18
00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.630
The world has truly entered the Great Pirate Era!

19
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.850
This is the time known as
the Great Pirate Era!

20
00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:35.640
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

21
00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:41.440
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

22
00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:42.690
One Piece!

23
00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.700
Compasses? Not for me. Left them all behind

24
00:00:53.580 --> 00:00:58.500
I'm headed out to sea, with my heart serving as guide

25
00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.540
Following the ancient map to the spot marked "X" reveals

26
00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.760
Yeah, it's only legendary till someone proves it's real

27
00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:13.710
When the world's got you down,

28
00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:16.850
lean on your crew, they'll turn it around

29
00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:22.190
Their biorhythm will carry you through

30
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.230
We're gonna make the most of it

31
00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:31.400
Come aboard and bring along all your hopes and dreams

32
00:01:31.610 --> 00:01:36.990
I know together we'll find everything we're looking for

33
00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.040
Got some change to my name,

34
00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:43.250
and maybe you wanna be my friend?

35
00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:48.130
We are, we are on the cruise!

36
00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:49.760
WE ARE!

37
00:01:50.050 --> 00:01:57.680
<b>The Silent Man</b>

38
00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:05.020
Rotten woman!

39
00:02:05.020 --> 00:02:08.400
How dare you try to make a fool
of the great Captain Usopp!

40
00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.650
Insulting me for having
the blood of a pirate.

41
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:15.450
Please, you don't have
to do this, Usopp.

42
00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.350
[KAYA]
Klahadore.

43
00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:40.110
[KAYA]
Klahadore, are you there?

44
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:43.230
Hello, Klahadore?

45
00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:48.610
No. Merry!

46
00:02:48.610 --> 00:02:50.690
[KAYA] Merry!

47
00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:53.030
What's going on?!
What happened to you?!

48
00:02:53.030 --> 00:02:54.400
Please, wake up! Merry!

49
00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.780
Please, don't die!

50
00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:01.870
Oh, thank goodness. You're
still alive. I was worried.

51
00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:03.000
Merry.

52
00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:06.420
[MERRY groaning]

53
00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.290
[KAYA yelps]

54
00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.500
[KAYA] You have to tell me
who did this to you.

55
00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:15.260
Klahadore. That's who.
He attacked me.

56
00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:16.720
[gasps]

57
00:03:17.220 --> 00:03:21.970
He's a... He's a pirate.
He's never been anything else.

58
00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:24.810
[KAYA] But...
how could that be?

59
00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:28.600
[MERRY] He got close to you just
so he could steal your fortune.

60
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:30.230
That's all he's ever wanted.

61
00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:31.940
[KAYA] It can't be.

62
00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.400
No! You're lying!

63
00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:49.330
[KAYA] Then... what Usopp spoke
about yesterday was the truth.

64
00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:54.340
That's right. And that's
what is most tragic.

65
00:03:54.340 --> 00:03:58.380
When he learned the truth, he tried
his hardest to get us to hear him out,

66
00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:00.390
but we were all too
shallow-minded,

67
00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.770
too confident in the closed off world
we've lived in for so long

68
00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:06.640
to listen to a single word.

69
00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:10.440
Quick! Run, Kaya!
They're gonna kill you!

70
00:04:10.440 --> 00:04:13.610
I promise, this'll all make
sense tomorrow.

71
00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.570
[MERRY] In our blind protection
of the villain in our midst,

72
00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:23.240
we drove away the one brave lad
whose desperate resolve

73
00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:27.570
he enacted for the sake and safety
of every person of this village,

74
00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.620
including you and I.

75
00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:31.040
[MERRY coughs]

76
00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.500
[KAYA] Someone!
Anyone! Help!

77
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.130
Merry needs help!

78
00:04:34.130 --> 00:04:36.710
[MERRY] No, miss.
It's of no use.

79
00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:41.180
The entire staff is on leave.

80
00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:43.810
No one has been
here since yesterday.

81
00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:45.470
[KAYA] What?!

82
00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:46.720
Then I just... I'll find...

83
00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.890
[MERRY] You cannot let
yourself get flustered, miss.

84
00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:53.650
We know the attack has
yet to begin, so be calm

85
00:04:53.650 --> 00:04:57.150
and think clearly about what
it is you have to do next.

86
00:04:58.780 --> 00:05:01.910
[MERRY] Because if Klahadore is
the thief we understand him to be

87
00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:06.660
and his goal is your fortune and your mansion,
then by all means, let him have it.

88
00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:10.120
None of this is worth
sacrificing your life over.

89
00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:12.960
[KAYA] Yes.

90
00:05:14.750 --> 00:05:18.710
It's a cruel truth, but you are the only one
who can stop Klahadore now, Kaya.

91
00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:21.800
Can you do it?

92
00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:25.350
I know... this is not...
your burden but still I must ask.

93
00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:29.060
Yes, I understand.
And I will do it.

94
00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.020
This isn't a situation
I can run away from.

95
00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.110
I know what consequences I face.

96
00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.530
I will find Klahadore
and I will finish this.

97
00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:45.200
[PEPPER] What? You saw
Klahadore heading to the shore?

98
00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.290
[ONION] Yeah, and he had
this weird, scary look on his face.

99
00:05:50.080 --> 00:05:51.620
Carrot, would you wake up?!

100
00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.710
Come on. It's way
too early for this.

101
00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:58.090
This is no time for laziness.

102
00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.050
Horrible things
could be happening right now!

103
00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:05.680
[ONION] I still think
the pirates are gonna attack soon.

104
00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:10.140
I know our Captain said that was a lie,
but I think he was the one that was lying!

105
00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.690
Yeah, you're probably right!

106
00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:14.730
It was weird.
He seemed off yesterday.

107
00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.730
The Captain wasn't
his usual self.

108
00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:19.940
[ONION] It's Kaya.
She's all right.

109
00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:33.330
Looks like something's got
her really bothered.

110
00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:36.330
Yeah, walking around outside
by herself doesn't seem right.

111
00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.460
Something's goin' on.
Something really weird.

112
00:06:44.010 --> 00:06:46.470
Come forth,
Meowban Brothers!

113
00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:53.140
<b>Sham
Ship Guard
Black Cat Pirates</b>

114
00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.140
Yes, Captain?
Did you call for us?

115
00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:56.440
<b>Buchi
Ship Guard
Black Cat Pirates</b>

116
00:06:55.020 --> 00:06:56.440
Well, did you?

117
00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:57.940
[SIAM] Siam!

118
00:06:57.940 --> 00:06:58.860
And Butchie!

119
00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:01.280
[BOTH] Together
we are the Meowban Brothers.

120
00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:02.610
At your service!

121
00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.990
[BOTH] Uhh...

122
00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.950
[ZORO] Hm?

123
00:07:05.950 --> 00:07:07.370
Butchie. Siam.

124
00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:11.660
We absolutely must get up this hill, but as
you can plainly see our path is blocked.

125
00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.210
If you would be so kind
as to remove this obstacle.

126
00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.410
Immediately.

127
00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.460
[BOTH whimper]

128
00:07:16.460 --> 00:07:19.590
No way! We couldn't do that!

129
00:07:19.590 --> 00:07:21.210
He looks too strong.
Right, Butchie?

130
00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:23.920
Oh yeah, he's strong.
Way stronger than us.

131
00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:25.340
[ZORO] Huh?

132
00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:28.890
[yelps] Besides we just guard
the ship, not fight people.

133
00:07:28.890 --> 00:07:30.050
He's got a point.

134
00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:32.930
We're really not the guys
you want to send into battle.

135
00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:35.230
So, they're
a couple of pansies.

136
00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.850
I guess they're not
the trump card after all.

137
00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:39.810
Siam, just do it already.

138
00:07:39.810 --> 00:07:41.690
[screams] What?!
Please, not me!

139
00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:42.690
And hurry!

140
00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:45.150
Okay, I'll go. Just stop yelling.

141
00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:49.070
The guy's crying like a baby.
What are they doing down there?

142
00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.410
[screaming]

143
00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.910
[NAMI] Of all people, why force

144
00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:53.200
– [NAMI] that guy into a fight?
– I'm gonna tear you up

145
00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:55.710
with these claws,
you just wait and see!

146
00:07:55.710 --> 00:07:57.120
I'm a vicious killing machine!

147
00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.920
And I'm coming
for you, you bad people!

148
00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:03.000
You come any closer
and I'll cut you in half!

149
00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:05.010
I'm not joking! I'll do it!

150
00:08:05.010 --> 00:08:07.090
[screaming]

151
00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.220
Not likely.

152
00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:14.180
[ZORO] Bastard!

153
00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.020
[SIAM] Too bad.

154
00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:18.770
It seems you fell
for my little ruse.

155
00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:20.400
I'm impressed
you blocked me.

156
00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.860
Considering what a
brilliant performance I gave.

157
00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:26.110
Don't let the tiny bit
of skill you have,

158
00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.650
cause you to underestimate
Siam of the Meowban Brothers.

159
00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:34.790
Are you missing something?

160
00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:37.330
Not that I would know
anything about it.

161
00:08:38.540 --> 00:08:39.670
There it is.

162
00:08:39.670 --> 00:08:41.540
Cat Burglar.

163
00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:43.250
[ZORO] Give me my swords back.

164
00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:44.380
Your swords?

165
00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:48.050
But you already have a sword,
how greedy can you be?

166
00:08:50.720 --> 00:08:53.220
Say goodbye,
swords. Goodbye!

167
00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.690
Now, I feel lighter.

168
00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:07.070
[ZORO] You should take care
with other people's things!

169
00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:11.160
[SIAM groaning]

170
00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.910
[SIAM] You really have
to be faster.

171
00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:20.710
'Cause I'm agile as a cat.

172
00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:25.170
Butchie, you're up!
Get in here!

173
00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:28.260
Sure thing, Siam!

174
00:09:28.260 --> 00:09:30.840
Cat...!

175
00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:31.930
[BOTH gasp]

176
00:09:33.640 --> 00:09:35.470
[BUTCHIE] 'Tastrophe!

177
00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:40.600
Damn, Butchie.
He got away from you.

178
00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.100
No, he's right there!
Now hold him tight this time!

179
00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:44.730
Careful, he's strong.

180
00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.780
Stronger than I thought he'd be,
even without all his blades.

181
00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:50.610
[ZORO] This is getting worse
by the second.

182
00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:55.570
If Tubby there woulda landed on me,
I'da been pounded into the dust.

183
00:09:55.570 --> 00:09:57.160
We'll get him
for sure this time.

184
00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:58.370
You got that right.

185
00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:02.000
One-Sword Technique's not
my forte fellas, but what the hell.

186
00:10:03.040 --> 00:10:05.000
Let's go, Butchie!

187
00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.710
Right, Siam! Let's do it!

188
00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:09.510
[BUTCHIE, SIAM] Pussy Willow March!

189
00:10:09.510 --> 00:10:10.920
[BUTCHIE, SIAM yell]

190
00:10:18.350 --> 00:10:20.810
This isn't good. They got
him on the defensive.

191
00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:24.980
What are you doing, Usopp?

192
00:10:24.980 --> 00:10:27.060
There's no way that Zoro
can gain any ground

193
00:10:27.060 --> 00:10:30.900
if he's too busy blocking
their attacks. I'm gonna help him.

194
00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:32.530
Take this.

195
00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.360
Lead Star!

196
00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:38.620
[grunts]

197
00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:39.950
[gasps]

198
00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.250
This is our chance!

199
00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:44.870
[ZORO groans]

200
00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.960
You're supposed to shoot
at the bad guys, you idiot!

201
00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.340
[USOPP] But I did.

202
00:10:52.340 --> 00:10:55.890
It was... It was like he moved
in front of my shot on purpose.

203
00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:57.640
But why would he do that?

204
00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:58.350
[gasps]

205
00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.810
[ZORO groaning]

206
00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:01.810
You dumbass. Don't help me.

207
00:11:01.810 --> 00:11:03.020
You wanna die?

208
00:11:03.020 --> 00:11:04.520
[whimpers]

209
00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:07.230
[ALL grunting]

210
00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:12.110
[NAMI] It's just a thought, but... Maybe
it's the two of us who just got saved.

211
00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:16.070
If you had actually hit one of those guys,
they would've come after us instead.

212
00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.370
And we wouldn't have a chance
of holding up against that.

213
00:11:19.870 --> 00:11:21.540
What a guy.

214
00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:24.000
All this time
he was worried about us.

215
00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:31.880
[ZORO] If I just had one more sword,
I could take these guys!

216
00:11:34.130 --> 00:11:35.930
I'm gonna get the swords.

217
00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:38.010
If I can get them back to Zoro,
there'll be no way he can lose.

218
00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.640
Let me get the swords!

219
00:11:40.640 --> 00:11:41.850
Don't push yourself.

220
00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.680
You can barely even
stand up on your own.

221
00:11:45.430 --> 00:11:46.390
Nami!

222
00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.070
[gasps]

223
00:11:55.900 --> 00:11:57.610
– [thud]
– [gasps]

224
00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:07.960
Nami!

225
00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:10.250
[JANGO] What
do you need swords for?

226
00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:14.460
[screams]

227
00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:20.260
[SIAM, BUTCHIE scream]

228
00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:29.480
No. I'm sorry. I can...
explain all of this.

229
00:12:33.400 --> 00:12:37.490
[KURO] The night
has long since passed.

230
00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:42.160
So why is it that you seem
to have made no progress on the plan?

231
00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:44.410
Captain... Kuro... No!

232
00:12:44.410 --> 00:12:46.370
He'll... He'll kill us all!

233
00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.300
It's all over.

234
00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:59.130
[groaning]

235
00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.260
[snoring]

236
00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:11.770
What the hell is going on?!

237
00:13:16.480 --> 00:13:20.320
[KURO] To think that these brats
have held you back.

238
00:13:20.320 --> 00:13:22.320
How the Black Cat Pirates have fallen.

239
00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:26.870
[KURO] What have you got
to say for yourself? Jango!

240
00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:35.090
[JANGO] But... Uh...
Well... I... You said...

241
00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:35.880
Uh, sorry, sir,

242
00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:41.800
but... you said letting the kid
go wouldn't cause any problems.

243
00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:44.550
[JANGO chuckles nervously]

244
00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:46.720
[KURO] I did say that.

245
00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:47.720
[USOPP] Huh?

246
00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:49.730
What's your point?
He's an idiot.

247
00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:51.600
I knew no one would listen
to his warnings

248
00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.980
and he would come stumbling back
to take a stand against us.

249
00:13:54.980 --> 00:14:00.690
But the one thing I hadn't taken account
for, was your inexcusable weakness!

250
00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:03.450
Sir. We're not weak.
It's just that...

251
00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.320
[grumbles]

252
00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:05.990
[SIAM] Who are you
to call us weak?!

253
00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.660
[BUTCHIE] Watch what
you say, Captain Kuro!

254
00:14:10.450 --> 00:14:12.710
[SIAM] You used
to be quite the killer.

255
00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.460
But, face it, Kuro,
it's been three years,

256
00:14:15.460 --> 00:14:17.750
and we haven't exactly
been living the good life

257
00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.710
waiting on a rich girl hand and foot.

258
00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:20.460
[BUTCHIE chuckles]

259
00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:21.720
Yeah, that's right!

260
00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:26.300
For three long years, we've been out
sinking pirate ships and massacring villages!

261
00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.060
Very good. Finished?

262
00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.980
No! You've done nothing
this whole time! We've been killing!

263
00:14:33.980 --> 00:14:37.360
You butler! There's no way
you can beat the Meowban Brothers!

264
00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.650
[ZORO gasps]

265
00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:44.110
Don't! Butchie, Siam, stop!

266
00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:49.410
[BUTCHIE, SIAM yelling]

267
00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.160
[SIAM] You are not
our captain anymore!

268
00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.120
[SIAM laughing]

269
00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:55.670
[BUTCHIE] So sorry,
but we have to kill you!

270
00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.130
[BOTH laughing]

271
00:14:58.130 --> 00:15:01.130
[yelling]

272
00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.760
[BOTH yelling]

273
00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:10.600
[ZORO grunts]

274
00:15:11.600 --> 00:15:16.310
[KURO] Who? Who are
you going to kill?

275
00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.730
[BUTCHIE, SIAM yelp]

276
00:15:17.730 --> 00:15:18.730
He snuck up!

277
00:15:18.730 --> 00:15:20.190
Right behind us!

278
00:15:23.780 --> 00:15:25.740
[SIAM] Huh?

279
00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:28.070
[BUTCHIE] Ah!
He... He's gone!

280
00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:31.030
[groaning]

281
00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:33.370
[JANGO] The... Pussyfoot Maneuver.

282
00:15:38.210 --> 00:15:40.130
[KURO] You know,
you're right.

283
00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:44.880
[BUTCHIE, SIAM whimpering]

284
00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:48.470
I do feel... a bit sluggish
after all these years.

285
00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:49.300
[gasps]

286
00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.810
[NAMI] He's handling
them like babies.

287
00:15:51.810 --> 00:15:54.480
And, those two
nearly defeated Zoro.

288
00:15:55.730 --> 00:16:00.270
[JANGO] With his Pussyfoot Maneuver,
Captain Kuro could shred everyone on this beach

289
00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:03.150
before we drew
our next breath.

290
00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.490
We wouldn't even see
it coming.

291
00:16:05.490 --> 00:16:11.660
There is no escape
from a killing machine like him.

292
00:16:11.660 --> 00:16:15.790
I knew he hadn't grown soft
when I saw that old habit of his,

293
00:16:15.790 --> 00:16:20.130
that strange way of lifting his glasses
so that he won't cut his face.

294
00:16:20.130 --> 00:16:22.840
It's like he never stopped
wearing those cat claws.

295
00:16:22.840 --> 00:16:24.380
They're almost
a part of his body.

296
00:16:24.380 --> 00:16:27.010
Of course, he hasn't
forgotten how to fight.

297
00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:29.340
[whimpers]

298
00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:38.980
You're very lucky.
I'm feeling somewhat merciful.

299
00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:42.560
Maybe these years
on dry land have made me soft.

300
00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:46.570
[KURO] I'll give
you five minutes.

301
00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:52.490
[KURO] If you can't deal
with the situation here

302
00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:57.250
in five minutes, then I'll kill
every last one of you.

303
00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:00.670
Now, have I made
myself clear?

304
00:17:04.550 --> 00:17:06.960
[JANGO whimpers]

305
00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.220
Oh, yes.

306
00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:09.050
[laughs nervously]

307
00:17:09.050 --> 00:17:11.220
Yes, of course,
that's perfectly clear!

308
00:17:11.220 --> 00:17:13.850
Thank you for being
so forgiving!

309
00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:17.100
All we have to do is take care
of this one guy!

310
00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:18.180
That's all.

311
00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:20.270
Five minutes will be more
than enough time for them.

312
00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:22.810
[JANGO laughs nervously]

313
00:17:28.740 --> 00:17:30.610
[BUTCHIE] We nearly had him
a few minutes ago!

314
00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:33.450
[SIAM] We won't need one minute
to finish him this time!

315
00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:37.450
We're counting on you!
Kill him! Kill him, dead!

316
00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:38.700
– [footsteps]
– [JANGO] Hm?

317
00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.380
Zoro!

318
00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:47.170
What the...?!

319
00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:51.840
Hey! Easy there! You can't just kick
'em! Those're my swords!

320
00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.300
How 'bout a "thanks"?

321
00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.470
[ZORO] Yeah.

322
00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.520
Ha. I appreciate it.

323
00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.770
[SIAM] You idiot! It won't matter
how many swords you have!

324
00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:06.270
[BUTCHIE] Now you'll die
holding three of 'em!

325
00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:08.360
[ZORO] Tiger!

326
00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:11.320
[laughing]

327
00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.780
You still... don't... get it.

328
00:18:14.530 --> 00:18:16.070
Trap!

329
00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:22.460
The clock is ticking.

330
00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:30.210
[ZORO] Carrying three swords
won't help you at all.

331
00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.220
Unless, you know
Three-Swords Style.

332
00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:43.520
Oh no.

333
00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:49.400
This is bad.

334
00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.540
[JANGO] He took down
the Meowban Brothers with one attack!

335
00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:14.260
[ZORO laughing]

336
00:19:14.260 --> 00:19:16.090
[ZORO] Don't worry.

337
00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:21.770
I can promise you. Everything will be
taken care of... in less than five minutes.

338
00:19:29.820 --> 00:19:31.480
[chuckles]

339
00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.820
Three. Three minutes left.

340
00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.080
[JANGO] Hm?

341
00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:42.620
[gasps]

342
00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:44.160
[BUTCHIE groaning]

343
00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.500
[BUTCHIE] I'll...
I'll slaughter him.

344
00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:49.790
[BUTCHIE coughs]

345
00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.920
Please... Captain.

346
00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.550
I can do it... Hypnotize me!

347
00:19:55.550 --> 00:19:57.090
[BUTCHIE coughs]

348
00:19:57.090 --> 00:20:00.100
Just... do it... Captain!

349
00:20:00.100 --> 00:20:04.520
He's still alive.
You do sloppy work.

350
00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.600
[ZORO] Huh?

351
00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.560
all that blubber
protected his vitals.

352
00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:12.860
[gasps]

353
00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:26.620
[growling]

354
00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:32.290
Butchie! Kill him!

355
00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:39.970
What?! Really?
You back for more?

356
00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:44.970
[ZORO] This guy
means business.

357
00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:48.440
He was trouble
when he was half this size.

358
00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.570
[ZORO] Then Jango had
to flip his psycho switch.

359
00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.160
[NAMI] Now's my chance!

360
00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:07.620
I gotta wake that lazy jerk up
while I still can!

361
00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:10.250
[JANGO] What is
that girl up to?

362
00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:13.420
[JANGO] Something tricky I'm sure.

363
00:21:13.420 --> 00:21:16.630
[NAMI] Everyone else is busy fighting
for their lives and he's just sleeping!

364
00:21:23.390 --> 00:21:24.930
Get up! You bum!

365
00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:26.810
Nami! Look out!

366
00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:27.890
[gasps]

367
00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:32.900
[JANGO chuckles] It was
nice knowing you.

368
00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:35.400
Dodge it! Quick!

369
00:21:37.070 --> 00:21:39.360
Hey! Stop it!

370
00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:44.240
[NAMI] I thought it was just a hypnotic
charm, but it's also his weapon!

371
00:21:45.080 --> 00:21:49.540
Nami! You can not just go
around stepping on people's eyes!

372
00:21:49.540 --> 00:21:50.290
[LUFFY grunts]

373
00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:53.630
No! How is that twerp
still alive?!

374
00:21:54.790 --> 00:21:59.710
That's either the best timing,
or the worst timing in the world. I can't tell.

375
00:22:02.930 --> 00:22:04.090
Uh. Luffy?

376
00:22:07.060 --> 00:22:09.520
[growls]

377
00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:11.060
Luffy!

378
00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:17.150
Owww!

379
00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:19.610
Crap! That guy's back
in the battle!

380
00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:21.440
No! This is terrible!

381
00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:24.110
Five minutes'll never
be enough time!

382
00:22:25.030 --> 00:22:28.200
Uh! That hurts, you jerk!
Why'd you do that?!

383
00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:30.160
Hey, sleeping beauty,
that wasn't me!

384
00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:31.710
It wasn't... me...

385
00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:38.920
You okay? Nami, did
you get hurt? Let me see it.

386
00:22:39.960 --> 00:22:42.380
[NAMI] Oh, it's
nothing. I'm fine.

387
00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.840
I've done everything
I can for now.

388
00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:48.140
The rest is up to you.

389
00:22:48.810 --> 00:22:51.810
Look, we have to win. We
can't afford to lose this fight.

390
00:22:51.810 --> 00:22:53.270
Do you understand?

391
00:22:55.350 --> 00:22:58.730
Okay. Go. Win this
and protect my treasure.

392
00:22:59.520 --> 00:23:01.320
[LUFFY] Yeah, yeah,
the treasure, I get it.

393
00:23:03.150 --> 00:23:05.490
One minute. And counting.

394
00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:09.620
Kuro can't be serious!

395
00:23:09.620 --> 00:23:12.040
We can't possibly finish
them in one minute!

396
00:23:12.040 --> 00:23:15.870
C'mon, guys, stop messing
around and end this already!

397
00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:29.050
Butchie! Quickly! There's
no more time to waste!

398
00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:32.020
Kill that three sword bastard!

399
00:23:32.020 --> 00:23:36.230
I'll take care
of the freaky, bendable kid!

400
00:23:42.320 --> 00:23:45.320
[JANGO] I'm coming
for you, Straw Hat!

401
00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:50.080
Hm? Hey, wait. Why
is that shady butler here?

402
00:23:52.740 --> 00:23:55.460
It's that kid. Didn't
he die falling off a cliff?

403
00:23:56.960 --> 00:23:58.500
Nice trick.

404
00:24:08.970 --> 00:24:10.970
[KURO] Huh?

405
00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:12.560
Don't ever sneak up on me!

406
00:24:16.020 --> 00:24:18.480
[KURO] Unless you
want to die!

407
00:24:18.480 --> 00:24:20.940
Kaya!

408
00:24:36.750 --> 00:24:38.670
No. Usopp. Are you okay?

409
00:24:40.000 --> 00:24:41.670
[USOPP] Kaya...
what are you doing here?

410
00:24:42.380 --> 00:24:44.630
Oh, Usopp. I'm so sorry.

411
00:24:45.460 --> 00:24:47.470
I don't know how
you'll ever forgive me.

412
00:24:47.470 --> 00:24:53.140
I just couldn't believe it... that Klahadore
is a scheming, murdering pirate.

413
00:24:53.140 --> 00:24:54.720
[USOPP] Never mind that.

414
00:24:54.720 --> 00:24:56.520
Why are you here?

415
00:24:56.520 --> 00:24:58.690
Kaya, your life is in danger.

416
00:24:58.690 --> 00:25:00.440
I told you to run
somewhere safe!

417
00:25:00.440 --> 00:25:04.270
I won't! You're still here
fighting! I won't run!

418
00:25:06.070 --> 00:25:09.490
You fought for me
after I treated you so badly.

419
00:25:09.490 --> 00:25:12.780
Look at you, you're barely
alive, but you're still so brave.

420
00:25:12.780 --> 00:25:13.580
I just...

421
00:25:13.580 --> 00:25:16.040
[KURO] This is
no place for a lady.

422
00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:18.710
Madam, please leave.

423
00:25:21.370 --> 00:25:24.130
Please. Stop. Don't do this.

424
00:25:27.300 --> 00:25:30.800
Stop! Stop this right
now, Klahadore!

425
00:25:36.390 --> 00:25:37.720
I know what you're up to.

426
00:25:37.720 --> 00:25:40.190
Merry already told me
about everything.

427
00:25:43.020 --> 00:25:45.360
[JANGO] Hm? What's the girl
from the mansion doing down here?

428
00:25:45.360 --> 00:25:48.940
The whole reason that we're here
is to murder that little rich girl.

429
00:25:48.940 --> 00:25:51.910
[PIRATE G] If she's here, then
we don't have to go to the village.

430
00:25:51.910 --> 00:25:54.410
[PIRATE I] All we gotta do is
kill her, right?

431
00:25:56.790 --> 00:25:58.540
[KAYA] Klahadore, please.

432
00:25:58.540 --> 00:26:02.000
If you want my fortune,
you can have it.

433
00:26:02.000 --> 00:26:03.790
Take it all and leave this village
right now I'm begging you.

434
00:26:05.340 --> 00:26:07.920
[KURO] I will gladly accept
your fortune, Miss Kaya.

435
00:26:07.920 --> 00:26:09.010
Thank you.

436
00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:11.970
But I want more.

437
00:26:11.970 --> 00:26:14.760
You see, simply acquiring
wealth isn't enough.

438
00:26:16.720 --> 00:26:20.520
More than anything else.

439
00:26:20.520 --> 00:26:23.190
What I want... is peace.

440
00:26:23.190 --> 00:26:25.400
You want peace?

441
00:26:25.400 --> 00:26:27.070
Yes. Just peace.

442
00:26:27.070 --> 00:26:30.490
Peace of mind.
It's simple really.

443
00:26:31.070 --> 00:26:35.070
I have spent the last three years
earning the trust of the entire village,

444
00:26:35.070 --> 00:26:40.330
and, to be honest, I find this new sense
of peace and tranquility quite comforting.

445
00:26:40.790 --> 00:26:46.170
When my plan comes to fruition, I will
live with this sublime peace of mind.

446
00:26:54.380 --> 00:26:56.010
Yes.

447
00:26:56.010 --> 00:27:02.180
The glorious comfort of a peaceful life
will be mine for forever and ever.

448
00:27:02.810 --> 00:27:05.150
In short, these pirates are coming!

449
00:27:09.770 --> 00:27:13.280
And you... will leave
your fortune to me and die.

450
00:27:13.280 --> 00:27:16.990
Miss Kaya, these things
will happen.

451
00:27:16.990 --> 00:27:20.200
No. You can't.

452
00:27:20.200 --> 00:27:22.410
You just can't be.

453
00:27:23.790 --> 00:27:26.210
Run away, Kaya! There's
no use talking to him!

454
00:27:26.210 --> 00:27:29.170
Please! Get out of here!

455
00:27:29.170 --> 00:27:31.250
[KAYA] You're not Klahadore.

456
00:27:31.250 --> 00:27:33.510
No! You're not!

457
00:27:34.990 --> 00:27:35.820
Kaya...

458
00:27:36.630 --> 00:27:39.800
Leave here, right now!
Never come back!

459
00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:43.270
Yes. I see. You're
all grown up now.

460
00:27:43.270 --> 00:27:46.770
So much has happened
in the last three years.

461
00:27:46.770 --> 00:27:49.400
Miss Kaya.

462
00:27:49.400 --> 00:27:52.530
Don't you remember
the things we went through?

463
00:27:52.530 --> 00:27:56.240
We spent so much time together.

464
00:27:56.240 --> 00:28:00.660
Even before your dear sweet
parents passed away.

465
00:28:00.660 --> 00:28:05.040
You were more than my master,
you were my best friend.

466
00:28:05.040 --> 00:28:06.540
So much time.

467
00:28:10.250 --> 00:28:11.590
So many memories.

468
00:28:11.590 --> 00:28:14.760
Together we suffered
and together we rejoiced.

469
00:28:14.760 --> 00:28:16.300
Like family.

470
00:28:16.800 --> 00:28:19.300
Klahadore.

471
00:28:20.300 --> 00:28:23.060
[KURO] I took you
on shopping trips to the city.

472
00:28:23.060 --> 00:28:26.270
I looked after you so diligently
when you were ill.

473
00:28:26.270 --> 00:28:29.690
And we used to talk
for hours and hours.

474
00:28:32.900 --> 00:28:36.690
Kaya, listen to me.
I was devoted to you.

475
00:28:36.690 --> 00:28:39.280
For so long.

476
00:28:39.280 --> 00:28:41.620
For so very long.

477
00:28:41.620 --> 00:28:45.540
I endured it.

478
00:28:45.540 --> 00:28:49.620
I quietly suffered so that today
I could end your life

479
00:28:49.620 --> 00:28:53.250
and take everything
that I deserve.

480
00:28:59.380 --> 00:29:05.640
I, who was once the feared and respected Captain Kuro,
had to bow and humble myself

481
00:29:05.640 --> 00:29:08.390
before some snot-nosed little girl.

482
00:29:08.390 --> 00:29:12.610
It went against every fiber of my being.

483
00:29:17.440 --> 00:29:19.030
Damn you.

484
00:29:19.610 --> 00:29:22.990
[KURO] Can you understand
the depth of these daily insults?

485
00:29:23.910 --> 00:29:28.710
Can you understand the rage created
by those transgressions against my pride?!

486
00:29:36.500 --> 00:29:39.130
[USOPP] Kuro!

487
00:29:44.800 --> 00:29:47.180
Thank you for reminding me.

488
00:29:49.430 --> 00:29:51.560
Usopp, I owe
you for hitting me.

489
00:29:51.560 --> 00:29:52.850
Let's get even.

490
00:29:53.400 --> 00:29:55.060
Oh no, Usopp!

491
00:29:55.060 --> 00:29:59.690
If I recall, you hit me as
hard as you could, right?

492
00:29:59.690 --> 00:30:00.700
[USOPP] Huh?

493
00:30:02.070 --> 00:30:03.450
[USOPP yelps]

494
00:30:03.450 --> 00:30:06.700
[groaning]

495
00:30:23.090 --> 00:30:27.930
[LUFFY] If he hates getting hit that much,
he's about to have a really bad day!

496
00:30:30.890 --> 00:30:37.750
As a kid I had a dream of a dazzling treasure

497
